                        %mi t
                      %mo )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \left( n_{i j}^{1}, n_{i j}^{2}, \ldots, n_{i j}^{t} \right)
              is a solution to the following system of equations.
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
